549a95b9cdbd7db0c96450cd3d24ca9","crc32":"05717884","sha1":"59db8bb3f403244ed52268b0f977f83ead7292ec","format":"Item Tile","rotation":"0"}],"files_count":29,"item_last_updated":1718381927,"item_size":492921218,"metadata":{"mediatype":"movies","collection":["more_animation","animationandcartoons"],"title":"Big Buck Bunny","description":"Big Buck Bunny in DivX 720p.","subject":"big buck bunny","runtime":"9:56","sound":"sound","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/","identifier":"BigBuckBunny_328","uploader":"paul@ellisfoundation.com","addeddate":"2009-12-09 00:16:15","publicdate":"2009-12-09 00:37:26","backup_location":"ia903604_18","ia_orig__runtime":"9 minutes 56 seconds","reviews-allowed":"none"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"cute in a strange twisted way.","reviewtitle":"B B B","reviewer":"quigs","reviewdate":"2010-02-26 00:28:32","createdate":"2010-02-26 00:28:32","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"so-so but it's not really animated is it?","reviewtitle":"no big deal","reviewer":"MaryAnna","reviewdate":"2010-03-15 22:09:29","createdate":"2010-03-15 22:09:29","stars":"2"},{"reviewbody":"....Pixar..Someone Knocking On Your Door..!","reviewtitle":"....Watch Out..","reviewer":"doowopbob","reviewdate":"2010-05-03 10:13:22","createdate":"2010-05-03 10:13:22","stars":"3"},{"reviewbody":"big bunny not bugs bunny","reviewtitle":"bunny","reviewer":"nigeldavahah","reviewdate":"2010-05-10 19:23:54","createdate":"2010-05-10 19:21:07","stars":"3"},{"reviewbody":"maryanna's comment is a little bewildering. She states its not animation. Just because this has been rendered on a computer does not mean that talented animators were not involved in bringing the characters to life. Its just a different medium. Like stop motion or 2d hand drawn animation. There is no magic button to press that will make this short on its own.I suggest she looks up the meaning of the word animation.\n\nanimation\nan\u00b7i\u00b7ma\u00b7tion\n-The  act,  process,  or  result  of  imparting  life,  interest,  spirit,  motion,  or  activity","reviewtitle":"This IS animation","reviewer":"danielps2fan","reviewdate":"2010-05-21 01:59:10","createdate":"2010-05-21 01:59:10","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"I enjoyed this short film very much. Great cast of players!","reviewtitle":"What a great film","reviewer":"radioman714","reviewdate":"2010-09-05 00:00:20","createdate":"2010-09-05 00:00:20","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Sadistically funny. I laughed inspite of my self. Lively characters with very expressive features. I was glued to the screen. Good luck to all of you you have talent.","reviewtitle":"Really unusual beautifully done animation.","reviewer":"PhaedraBlue","reviewdate":"2012-04-17 21:42:10","createdate":"2012-04-17 21:42:10","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"A compact, fast-paced tale of murder, revenge and acorns that is extremely well-done. One reviewer here called it \"sadistically funny,\" but \"sadistic\" is too strong a word. It's more a case of \"you came looking for trouble; now I'm gonna give it to you.\"\n\nDon't mess with the bunny.","reviewtitle":"don't mess with the bunny","reviewer":"Freddie Jaye","reviewdate":"2012-05-06 12:43:05","createdate":"2012-05-06 12:43:05","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"I liked it a lot. Entertaining and high quality.","reviewtitle":"Nice little film","reviewer":"MisterMcAtCCA","reviewdate":"2012-05-15 03:05:25","createdate":"2012-05-15 03:05:25","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"HTML5 Tag video. Excellent.\nBig Buck Bunny.","reviewtitle":"Good","reviewer":"Zohan Gzz","reviewer_itemname":"@zohan_gzz","reviewdate":"2019-02-09 01:08:43","createdate":"2019-02-09 01:08:43","stars":"5"},{"reviewtitle":"Big Buck 69","reviewbody":"when it comes to , you got it coming..   and being delivered this was intensly gratifying..   give them names from work and off you go !","stars":"5","reviewer":"LUX INTERIOR","reviewdate":"2020-11-30 18:47:49","createdate":"2020-11-30 18:47:49","reviewer_itemname":"@lux_interior"},{"reviewtitle":"Not for kids","reviewbody":"Not for kids and probably not for most adults, but it's almost funny.","stars":"3","reviewer":"Mia Gomes","reviewdate":"2021-04-07 00:25:20","createdate":"2021-04-07 00:25:20","reviewer_itemname":"@mia_gomes"},{"reviewtitle":"Ask","reviewbody":"Could me download  and it will upload in mychanel, please? syahabudinshibazz@gmail.com ","stars":"4","reviewer":"Syahab786","reviewdate":"2022-01-24 17:35:22","createdate":"2022-01-24 17:35:22","reviewer_itemname":"@syahab786"},{"reviewtitle":"big buck bunny is an awesome movie","reviewbody":"Big Buck Bunny is one of the greatest films ever written. Imagine how different our society would be if this masterpiece was never made!","stars":"5","reviewer":"GoodFuude","reviewdate":"2022-07-28 16:47:42","createdate":"2022-07-28 16:47:42","reviewer_itemname":"@goodfuude"},{"reviewtitle":"Awesome","reviewbody":"Loved it, the animation is very pleasing or something, art, amazing job!","stars":"5","reviewer":"blakksheepmedia","reviewdate":"2023-10-04 01:30:57","createdate":"2023-10-04 01:30:57","reviewer_itemname":"@blakksheepmedia"},{"reviewtitle":"\ud835\ude3f\ud835\ude64\ud835\ude6c\ud835\ude63\ud835\ude61\ud835\ude64\ud835\ude56\ud835\ude59 Link","reviewbody":"DOWNLOAD LINK\nhttps://shrinke.us/467zL","stars":"5","reviewer":"ROCK Justin Gaming","reviewdate":"2023-10-16 08:34:32","createdate":"2023-10-16 08:34:32","reviewer_itemname":"@rock_justin_gaming"},{"reviewtitle":"Permission to upload on my YouTube channel","reviewbody":"It would be grateful  if you permit me to upload this vedeo on my YouTube channel\nGmail I'd: sushma.swami06@gmail.com \n","stars":"5","reviewer":"Shushma06","reviewdate":"2024-05-30 03:04:25","createdate":"2024-05-30 03:04:25","reviewer_itemname":"@shushma06"},{"reviewtitle":"Request for Permission to Upload \"Big Buck Bunny\" on YouTube","reviewbody":"My name is Gaurav, and I am the creator and owner of the YouTube channel \"Tiny Tots Storytime World,\" where we focus on providing high-quality, educational, and entertaining content for young children. I am writing to express my admiration for \"Big Buck Bunny,\" a remarkable film that perfectly aligns with the values and quality content we strive to offer our audience. gauravlamba46@gamil.com\n\nGiven the exceptional animation and the engaging storyline of \"Big Buck Bunny,\" I am reaching out to formally request your permission to upload this film to my YouTube channel. I am confident that this film will captivate my audience and provide them with both entertainment and valuable lessons.\n\nI would be honored to feature \"Big Buck Bunny\" on my channel and am committed to upholding the highest standards of respect for your work. Should you have any specific terms, conditions, or guidelines regarding the use of the content, I am more than willing to comply to ensure that we maintain the integrity and respect of your intellectual property.\n\nThank you for considering my request. I believe that featuring \"Big Buck Bunny\" on my channel will help further its reach and allow more children to enjoy and learn from this delightful film.","stars":"5","reviewer":"Gaurav Lamba","reviewdate":"2024-06-11 12:28:56","createdate":"2024-06-11 12:28:56","reviewer_itemname":"@gaurav_lamba"}],"server":"dn801203.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn801203":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5440158357"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-15 05:45:11.250245"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1721946286,"workable_servers":["dn801203.us.archive.org"]}